; The Amiga inside E-UAE, to Workbench on the uaegfx card: a minimal OS 3.2
; startup. Steps go to SYS:guest.log (DIZ:guest/sys/guest.log outside).
C:SetPatch QUIET
Echo "guest: booted" >SYS:guest.log
C:MakeDir RAM:T RAM:ENV RAM:Clipboards >NIL:
Assign T: RAM:T
Assign ENV: RAM:ENV
Assign CLIPS: RAM:Clipboards
Assign ENVARC: SYS:Prefs/Env-Archive
Assign LOCALE: SYS:Locale
Copy >NIL: ENVARC: RAM:ENV ALL NOREQ
C:List >NIL: DEVS:Monitors/~(#?.info) TO T:M LFORMAT "DEVS:Monitors/%s"
C:Execute T:M
Echo "guest: monitors loaded" >>SYS:guest.log
C:IPrefs
Echo "guest: IPrefs done" >>SYS:guest.log
C:LoadWB
Echo "guest: LoadWB done" >>SYS:guest.log
C:Wait 5
C:rtgtest WBINFO >>SYS:guest.log
Echo "guest: workbench up" >>SYS:guest.log
EndCLI >NIL:
